   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">you don&#39;t quite have everything in your data frame, and certain you have more Excel data.  You will want to look at things like position=&quot;dodge&quot;, and maybe ?melt in library reshape2.<div><br></div><div>I think your &quot;Did Not Comply&quot; is 1-Complied?  That&#39;s another column even in Excel, and it will be in your df as well.  If you want 4 total bars, your dr needs 4 numbers in it. </div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
